---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Nande Mahalunge Real Estate & Upcoming Projects | Investment Guide 2026"
  description="Exhaustive guide to Nande-Mahalunge real estate, property values, PMRDA ring road, and Mahindra Lifespaces upcoming ₹3,500 Cr development across 13.46 acres."
  canonical="https://www.mahindralifespaceshomes.in/nande-mahalunge-real-estate"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>Strategic Micro-Market</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        Nande–Mahalunge Real Estate: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">West Pune's Highest Potential Growth Belt</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Why institutional developers like Mahindra Lifespaces are committing landmark capital (~₹3,500 Cr) to the Nande–Mahalunge corridor, and how investors can capitalize on this transformation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Drivers -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-100">1. Arterial Linkage</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
          Direct bypass to Hinjewadi Phase 1 IT Park and Mumbai-Pune Expressway via the proposed 36-meter wide PMRDA road network.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-100">2. Natural Riverine Buffer</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
          Flanked by the Mula-Mutha riverbed and surrounding green hillocks, safeguarding the corridor from industrial pollution and over-densification.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-100">3. ₹3,500 Cr Mahindra Anchor</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
          Mahindra’s 13.46-acre acquisition announced in October 2025 cements the corridor as an institutional Grade-A residential destination.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Box -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-950 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-4">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">Invest in West Pune’s Next Landmark</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Submit your Expression of Interest to receive confidential pre-launch investor briefs, layout blueprints, and early pricing sheets.
      </p>
      <button
        data-open-modal
        data-interest="Nande Mahalunge Investor Brief"
        class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
      >
        Download Investor Brief (PDF)
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
